{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kQn2ZL85HV1795414461.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人鄭家華於節目中推介閱文集團(772)，短劇賽道爆發，帶動收入按年大升，顯示「IP+AI」的戰略加速發揮作用，而且公司持續回購股份，都有助股價保持穩定。</p><p></p><p>鄭家華原本設定21.38元買入，但在節目中改為現價22.32元買入，目標價上調至25.18元，止蝕價在同步調高至19.68元。</p><p></p><p>閱文集團(772)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$21.38→現價$22.32入</p><p>目標：$24.88→$25.18</p><p>止蝕：$19.48→$19.68</p><p></p><p>股評人莫灝楠推介MSCI印度ETF(INDA)，指油價和印度股市呈反比，而且AI交易倒帶，資金或正流入其他市場，適逢印度指數PE低於歷史均值，有值博空間。</p><p></p><p>莫灝楠建議夜盤現價即53.33美元買入，目標價看58美元，止蝕價定於50美元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"1325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H0zoZwmSvy1795414454.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>MSCI印度ETF(INDA)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→53.33美元</p><p>目標：58美元</p><p>止蝕：50美元</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.347467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:12.499439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:25:17.551137+00:00","content_hash":"bc0ed6b37ab693dd0dc2d00b872b084b2a74997629e14d84c4a4fee3cd4a42e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.347467+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}